OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after 'distressing' message
OL,4,Ashown on phone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football fan has been arrested after
OL,7,Fa "potentially alarming and
OL,8,Fdistressing" message was shown on a
OL,9,Fphone at a match, police said.
OL,11,FAn image shared on social media showed
OL,12,Fa man holding up a phone which appeared
OL,13,Fto read "police killed your own" during
OL,14,FMiddlesbrough's 1-0 win over Wolves in
OL,15,Fthe Championship at the Riverside on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FPC Chris Hilton, Cleveland Police's
OL,19,Fdedicated football officer, confirmed a
OL,20,F20-year-old had been arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of a public order offence.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
